# ===== 工作区沙箱（体积大、非交付物）=====
workspace/

# ===== 依赖 =====
**/node_modules/

# ===== 运行时记忆（实盘，含个人隐私，绝不入库/推送）=====
# 仓库只保存 *.template.md 模板；实盘文件由 install.sh 生成。
plugin/memory/USER.md
plugin/memory/MEMORY.md
plugin/memory/daily/
plugin/memory/pending.md
plugin/memory/dreams.md
plugin/memory/*.tmp

# ===== 隔离测试产物 =====
**/test-xdg/
**/test2/
**/test3/
da-test/

# ===== 凭据 / 密钥（绝不入库）=====
**/auth.json
*.key
*.keystore
*.pem
.env
.env.*

# ===== 临时文件 =====
*.tmp
*.log
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# ===== 安装备份 =====
*.bak
*.bak.*
